1
00:00:00,750 --> 00:00:02,930
Previously on Captain Tsubasa.

2
00:00:02,930 --> 00:00:09,820
In the match with an 11-to-1 handicap, Tsubasa toyed with the opposing team through excellent ball control.

3
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:15,540
Then, former Brazilian national team forward Roberto Hongo suddenly appeared...

4
00:00:15,540 --> 00:00:20,500
...and Tsubasa converted his cross into a goal, winning an undisputed victory over Wakabayashi.

5
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:21,500
I lost.

6
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:24,790
I lost to this shrimp.

7
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:26,080
A match!

8
00:00:26,080 --> 00:00:27,420
We'll have a match!

9
00:00:27,850 --> 00:00:32,240
They decided to settle their issues on the day of the interschool tournament.

10
00:00:32,240 --> 00:00:38,440
Roberto, who had been watching everything up to this point, offered to coach them.

11
00:00:38,440 --> 00:00:44,270
After that, to prove his talent, Tsubasa attempted an overhead kick.

12
00:00:45,650 --> 00:00:46,690
Here!

13
00:00:46,690 --> 00:00:51,970
He only just saw my move, but he's trying it right away.

14
00:00:51,970 --> 00:00:56,950
He's someone who sets his mind on performing every technique he sees.

15
00:00:56,950 --> 00:00:58,580
Go!

16
00:00:59,450 --> 00:01:00,740
At the end of practice...

17
00:01:00,740 --> 00:01:04,220
...having succeeded in performing the overhead kick, Tsubasa...

18
00:01:04,220 --> 00:01:09,900
...was ready to face Wakabayashi together with his new friend.

19
00:01:26,240 --> 00:01:27,720
Overhead kick!

20
00:01:27,720 --> 00:01:28,480
Tsubasa...

21
00:01:31,870 --> 00:01:36,300
Huh? What's wrong, Mom? Why do you have a sheet on your head?

22
00:01:39,130 --> 00:01:41,990
I wonder why?

23
00:01:42,520 --> 00:01:48,090
Translation: ARE-YOU-SURE
www.areyousuresubs.com

24
00:01:53,980 --> 00:01:59,570
The scent of the grass when I stumbled

25
